        "presentation": 0
      },
      "studentFinalAnswer": "∴ Speed of the train = 40 km/h.",
      "finalAnswerCorrect": false,
      "teacherNote": "You have written out a solution for a train speed problem from Quadratic Equations rather than solving the given question on Arithmetic Progression. Be sure to check the question number and text carefully before writing your answer."
    }
